@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include _style.iuml
title UML 类图（补充）｜权限、审核与业务记录
left to right direction
hide circle
hide empty members

class "用户\nUser" as User {
  - userId : UUID
  - role : Role
  + canActAs(role) : Boolean
}
enum "角色\nRole" as Role {
  PARTICIPANT
  ORGANIZER
  CHECKER
  ADMIN
}
class "活动\nEvent" as Event {
  - eventId, organizerId : UUID
}
class "活动场次\nEventSession" as Session {
  - sessionId : UUID
}
class "检票授权\nCheckInGrant" as Grant {
  - grantId : UUID
  - checkerId, sessionId : UUID
  - enabled : Boolean
  + permits(checker, session) : Boolean
}
class "审核记录\nReviewRecord" as Review {
  - reviewId, reviewerId : UUID
  - decision : APPROVE / REJECT
  - comment : String
  - reviewedAt : Instant
}
class "通知\nNotification" as Notice {
  - notificationId, recipientId : UUID
  - eventId, registrationId : UUID
  - content : String
  - status : PENDING / DELIVERED / FAILED
  - retryCount : Integer
  + markDelivered()
  + scheduleRetry()
}
class "操作日志\nAuditLog" as Audit {
  - logId, actorId : UUID
  - targetType, targetId : String
  - action, result : String
  - occurredAt : Instant
}
class "签到记录\nCheckInRecord" as CheckIn {
  - checkInId, registrationId : UUID
  - checkerId : UUID
  - checkedInAt : Instant
}

User ..> Role
User "1" -- "0..*" Grant : 检票人员
Session "1" -- "0..*" Grant : 授权范围
User "1" -- "0..*" Review : 平台管理员
Event "1" *-- "0..*" Review : 审核历史
User "1" -- "0..*" Notice : 接收通知
User "1" -- "0..*" Audit : 执行操作
User "1" -- "0..*" CheckIn : 执行检票

note bottom of Grant
  检票权限必须同时满足角色与场次授权。
  不能仅凭票码可解析就允许签到。
end note
note bottom of Notice
  通知在业务提交后派发，失败保留重试记录。
  通道、保留期限与隐私访问范围待确认。
end note
legend left
  结构性图。与主类图的同名类表示同一领域实体，此处只展示相关字段。
  角色兼任方式、完整权限矩阵与非功能指标仍待需求方确认。
endlegend
@enduml

